# Fugløy hints for seadrg01.cmd: Sea Dragon (Wayne Westmoreland and Terry Gilman, 1982),
# in the public domain since 1995. Identities from `fugloy --write-hints`.
#
# The file loads the game at $5200 and starts at a 15-byte stub at $8881 that copies it down:
#   LD HL,5200H / LD DE,497FH / LD BC,3681H / LDIR / JP 497FH
# The two lines at the end are the ones the listing header proposes. With them the game
# is analyzed at $497F, where it runs, and the zmac output still rebuilds the same image.
fugloy-hints 1
program sha256 8fa50e79d9f699e23f5daf41c654fc82c288e4df8816d5aaebd709bce43ed2af
block 0 length $3690 hash d2d65cca12ac798d    # start $5200
block 0:$0000 relocate $497F $3681
block 0:$0000 entry
